// images.exe's resources: a bitmap, an icon with two images (16 by 16 with alpha, 32 by 32 in 16 colours with a
// mask) and a cursor, made by hand (see images.c for their pixels). Built with llvm-rc, without the preprocessor.
LANGUAGE 0, 0
1 BITMAP "images.bmp"
2 ICON "images.ico"
3 CURSOR "images.cur"
